l."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Have Got"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use have got + infinitive to talk about obligation (something you must do) or talk about an arrangement for the future that is already made."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have got to look through these listings."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have got to make a decision."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have got to go for an appointment in the morning."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Comparatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you compare, two things you use a <span class=\"strong\">comparative</span>. You can use than. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When comparing with than, the adjective you use can change  depending on the number of syllables it has: <ul><li>1-syllable adjectives: add <span class=\"italic\">-er </span>to the adjective<span class=\"italic\"> cheap \u2192 cheap<span class=\"strong\">er</span></span></li><li>2-syllable adjectives ending in -y: change the -y to -<span class=\"italic\">ier </span><span class=\"italic\">busy \u2192 bus<span class=\"strong\">ier </span></span> </li><li>Adjectives with 3 or more syllables: use <span class=\"italic\">more</span> with the unchanged adjective<span class=\"italic\"> expensive \u2192 <span class=\"strong\">more</span> expensive</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Certain adjectives have irregular forms in the comparative. <br> For example:  <br>good \u2192 better <br> bad \u2192 worse"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to compare"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to examine two or more things in order to show how they are the same or different from each other "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's compare the two listings. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about rooms and objects in them."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "budget"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the money that is available to a person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to think about my budget. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "furniture"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "large objects you use in a home"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The apartment includes furniture."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ensuite"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bathroom that is joined to a bedroom"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The apartment unit includes an ensuite."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "guest bathroom"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small bathroom that contains a toilet and a sink"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Does the unit include a guest bathroom?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "full bathroom"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bathroom that contains four key items: a bathtub, a shower, a toilet, and a sink  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The condo includes a full bathroom."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "office space"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a room that provides a place to do work "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The condo includes an office space. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to sleep on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to think about something overnight before you make a decision "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have got to sleep on this tonight."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le03ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a city in the world."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find two classified ads for apartments in that city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the table."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Apartment A\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Apartment B\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How many square feet is it?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How much is the rent?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Does it include any furniture? What else does it include?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\":